From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kill3rEz <98993017+Kill3rEz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:05:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dodge: Drop the display commonsys-intf namespace import

vendor/qcom/opensource/commonsys-intf/display is not a soong namespace on
PenguinOS (CLO), so importing it fails. Its modules live in the root
namespace there.
---
 Android.bp | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 377249f..0d6eb6d 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -7,7 +7,6 @@ soong_namespace {
         "hardware/oplus",
         "hardware/qcom-caf/sm8750",
         "vendor/oneplus/sm8750-common",
-        "vendor/qcom/opensource/commonsys-intf/display",
         "device/oneplus/dodge",
     ],
 }
